WEBVTT

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
moo-shi

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
presents:

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
http://moo-shi.no-ip.info/ #moo-shi@irc.rizon.net

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.480
<i>The Great Kanto Desert.</i>

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:39.510
<i>Sunabouzu and Kosuna...</i>

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:43.760
<i>...are on their way home after a job well done...</i>

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:51.230
<i>Oh. There're homeless
children out here...</i>

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:53.650
They're strandees.

00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:56.200
<i>Do you suppose he's their guardian?</i>

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.260
Probably.

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:00.240
<i>W-water...</i>

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:04.100
Let's go.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:04.580
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.910
<i>W-wait! We're not helping them?!</i>

00:02:07.910 --> 00:02:09.790
<i>They're children!</i>

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:10.970
Dumbass!

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:15.680
We're on the verge of being stranded too,
thanks to that magnetic storm!

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.880
Help 'em if you wanna die too.

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:20.180
But don't blame me...

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:28.790
<i>Sister...</i>

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:33.060
<i>Don't talk... You'll only die sooner...</i>

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:44.550
<i>Good thing there was a town nearby!</i>

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:47.950
Is my intuition great or what?!

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:51.450
Can't always rely on machines
if you wanna survive in this desert!

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.790
<i>You're surprisingly nice!</i>

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:56.020
Huh?

00:02:56.020 --> 00:03:00.230
<i>After all, you turned right around
the instant you found the town...</i>

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:01.660
<i>To help them, right?</i>

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:05.610
Yep. Kids like them sell for quite a bit!

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.100
<i>Eh?! Sell?!</i>

00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:09.240
What were you thinking?

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:14.070
Saving a life means a reward.
If not their money, then their body.

00:03:14.070 --> 00:03:16.410
It's only natural.

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:19.820
<i>Ah, I see. You're so cool...</i>

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:25.080
I've never once lost a
pick-up-strewn-money contest!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.330
<i>Impressive, Master!</i>

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:30.410
Another strandee.

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:34.420
<i>Huh? He's with those kids!</i>

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:38.920
A slight case of dehydration...

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:42.170
Still, this guy's really built!

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:44.880
<i>Not to mention good-looking...</i>

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.430
I bet he'd...

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:48.730
<i>Are we selling him?</i>

00:03:49.920 --> 00:03:51.700
How're they?

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.900
<i>It looks like they're
going to be just fine.</i>

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.570
Hey, get up!

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:57.900
Hey, you wanna die?!

00:03:58.400 --> 00:03:59.730
Here's some water.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:03.110
Whoopsies!

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:11.640
<i>"Labor Contract"</i>

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:10.810
Hold your horses. First you sign this.

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.380
<i>I'm saved!</i>

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.580
Wonderful!

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:21.660
Now pay the million yen
for saving your life.

00:04:21.660 --> 00:04:23.680
<i>Like I really have that kind of money.</i>

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:27.140
Then you'll just have to earn it...

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.840
You were probably trying to make
some money off of those kids too,

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:32.730
but I guess you screwed up...

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.140
<i>I'd never do that!</i>

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:38.380
<i>I did lose my direction in
the magnetic storm two days ago</i>

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.900
<i>and wound up in big trouble.</i>

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:42.070
<i>But...</i>

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:49.980
<i>When I saw these kids, I just
couldn't bear to NOT help them...</i>

00:04:58.220 --> 00:04:58.960
<i>What?</i>

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:02.510
Don't tell me you actually helped someone

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.700
without care for profit or loss?

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:07.510
<i>Yeah... Is that weird?</i>

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:08.940
Yes!

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:14.400
You can't survive in this hellish desert
thinking creepy crap like that!

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:18.090
<i>- It's always like this!</i>

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:20.020
- You're always doing this, dumbass?!

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:23.570
Ahh, screw this! How about the brats?!

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:25.120
<i>They got nothing.</i>

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.860
We'll just hafta sell 'em!

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:28.310
<i>H-hey!</i>

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:30.280
What?!

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:34.630
<i>I'll pay for the children too!
Just give them their freedom!</i>

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.960
Suit yourself, moron.

00:05:45.260 --> 00:05:50.720
<i>It certainly was nice to have
the IOU's signed without any trouble!</i>

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:55.180
Now you're officially mine...

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:57.640
Run and you'll be a wanted man!

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:01.030
<i>I'd never run! I WILL pay you back!</i>

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:10.230
<i>Eat up.</i>

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:12.040
<i>Eh? But...</i>

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:14.580
<i>Stop!</i>

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:18.510
<i>It's all right.
I don't feel like eating...</i>

00:06:18.510 --> 00:06:20.410
<i>Sheesh...</i>

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.420
<i>Come to think of it,
I still don't know your names...</i>

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:25.860
<i>Oh, I'm Asari!</i>

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.630
<i>My sister is Shijimi!</i>

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:32.350
<i>I'm Kaido Masaru. Nice to meet you!</i>

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:41.530
<i>"Personnel Bazaar"</i>

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:43.570
<i>No! Father!</i>

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:45.410
<i>I'm sorry, Tsuyuko!</i>

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:48.610
<i>I promise I'll be back
once I've saved enough money!</i>

00:06:48.610 --> 00:06:50.210
<i>Honey! Honey!</i>

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:51.580
<i>N-Norio!</i>

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:53.250
<i>Here's your money!</i>

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:56.550
<i>No! No! Give Dad back!</i>

00:06:56.550 --> 00:06:59.190
Ooh, look at 'em go!

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:00.510
<i>How sad!</i>

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:03.900
You're in a position
to pity other people?

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.690
<i>This is one fine man!</i>

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:11.720
Isn't he, though?! Isn't he, though?!

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:13.640
Just look at these muscles!

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:15.840
And these straight teeth!

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:18.890
They could withstand 10 years
of ultra-intensive labor!

00:07:19.260 --> 00:07:21.060
<i>Oh! So, how much?!</i>

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.150
1.5 million...

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.060
<i>"Now's your chance!!"</i>

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.060
<i>"Bargain!!"</i>

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.060
<i>...and 105 yen!</i>

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.060
...and 105 yen!

00:07:26.060 --> 00:07:26.870
<i>Too much!</i>

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:27.950
<i>"Ultra 
Intensive 
Labor"</i>

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:27.950
<i>"Looking for 
young and 
healthy men!"</i>

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:27.950
<i>Idiot!</i>

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.530
<i>I specialize in pretty little girls...</i>

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:42.800
<i>Things certainly are tough...</i>

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.080
Damn!

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:47.300
<i>What do you say we lower the price?</i>

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:52.560
Never! I want 1,500,105 yen!
I absolutely want it!

00:07:52.560 --> 00:07:53.550
Bastard!

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:55.410
What're you laughin' at?!

00:07:55.410 --> 00:07:58.350
Who do you think is
suffering 'cause of you?!

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:02.110
<i>You damn greed monger!</i>

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:03.850
<i>You want money that badly?!</i>

00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:04.690
Duh!

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.730
<i>Even if it means trampling
the weak and the poor?!</i>

00:08:07.730 --> 00:08:08.980
Duh!

00:08:13.930 --> 00:08:15.390
What's with you?!

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.070
What're you trying to do?

00:08:17.570 --> 00:08:21.370
You sacrifice yourself to try and save some kids by giving them your food

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.460
and spoutin' unprofitable crap...

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:26.860
<i>I can't help it.</i>

00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:28.910
<i>That's just how I am.</i>

00:08:32.040 --> 00:08:36.050
Fine. Just looking at you pisses me off,
so let me fill you in.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:41.720
A long time ago, some people
tried to create a society

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:45.260
where everyone helped each
other and lived happily.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:48.230
And what happened to
the world as a result?

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:51.280
A bunch of scum mistakenly
felt they had gotten stronger...

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:55.850
...and you know what they
did to this planet, right?

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:59.740
Weren't the ones who made
this hellhole of a desert

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:03.870
the weaklings that you love oh-so-much?

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:09.130
You and wusses who only know
how to preach about idealism

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:12.020
give off the exact same stench.

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:15.220
<i>M-Master!</i>

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.140
<i>Stop, you brats!</i>

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:19.650
<i>Stop already!</i>

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:22.210
If only they'd stop for 'em...

00:09:24.320 --> 00:09:25.180
<i>Huh?</i>

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:26.800
Hold it!

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:30.200
Do you honestly think
you can beat that many?!

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:32.020
Just leave 'em be!

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:34.780
<i>Shijimi!</i>

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.530
<i>Damn brat!</i>

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:39.890
<i>Shijimi!</i>

00:09:41.680 --> 00:09:43.380
<i>Thought you could get away, huh?!</i>

00:09:43.380 --> 00:09:44.830
<i>Let go!</i>

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.500
<i>Let go!</i>

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:55.030
Hey, now! What can you do unarmed?!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.090
We can't let you
get injured now, can we?!

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:05.060
<i>Could you let me have
my way just this once?!</i>

00:10:05.810 --> 00:10:08.040
<i>I don't wish to hurt
the ones who saved me.</i>

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.520
<i>- Eep!</i>

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:09.520
- Eep!

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.850
<i>I don't need you to tell me now...</i>

00:10:12.850 --> 00:10:18.030
<i>I know all too well that
what I do is extremely pointless...</i>

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:22.880
<i>That's why I've been
made fun of everywhere I go...</i>

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:26.560
<i>That's why I have no money
and no girlfriend...</i>

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.290
<i>But even so!</i>

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:35.920
<i>S-such forcefulness...
I was scared senseless.</i>

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.310
Those eyes...

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:45.310
<i>I know!</i>

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.200
<i>Yes!</i>

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.720
<i>What're you doing?!</i>

00:10:48.720 --> 00:10:50.250
<i>You with these brats?!</i>

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.980
<i>I know!</i>

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:57.500
<i>I'm sad, but...</i>

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.880
<i>But!</i>

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:01.370
<i>I have no choice...</i>

00:11:02.100 --> 00:11:04.490
<i>It's the only way I'm able to live!</i>

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:08.940
<i>I don't have a choice!</i>

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.430
<i>I-Incredible!</i>

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:32.990
<i>I didn't know he was that strong!</i>

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:37.110
<i>Wouldn't we be in trouble
if we made him mad too?!</i>

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.430
<i>You'll pay for this!</i>

00:11:46.110 --> 00:11:47.390
<i>Mister!</i>

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:55.220
That was quite an interesting
performance you gave...

00:11:55.220 --> 00:11:56.380
<i>You're good.</i>

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:01.880
Whoops! That's close enough!

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:04.410
So you're a soldier, huh...

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.080
<i>Eh?!</i>

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:07.660
A pretty elite one, too.

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:11.100
Like the ones that sneak around
the desert in small numbers...

00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:15.980
I've seen 'em only once before,
in the very depths of the desert...

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:20.240
I watched a bandit gang
somewhat famous for its cruelty

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:24.930
get wiped out instantly by a strange
armed group I'd never seen before...

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:28.290
It was no ordinary military unit...

00:12:29.680 --> 00:12:32.420
...and it wasn't
another bandit gang, either.

00:12:32.780 --> 00:12:36.090
They made no wasted movements,
accomplished their goal,

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:40.220
and then left like the wind,
leaving no traces behind...

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:43.230
The techniques they used...

00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:47.100
...were exactly like
the ones you used just now.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:51.640
It's called like martial arts
or something, right?

00:12:51.640 --> 00:12:53.000
<i>What's that?</i>

00:12:53.640 --> 00:12:57.170
A killing technique passed down
from before the Dark Age, I hear.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:13:03.700
Can't blame you for not knowin'
about it. It did die out long ago.

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:10.220
But I guess it survived just fine
in the Oasis... in the military.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.220
Looks like I hit it on the nose.

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.230
It finally adds up.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:21.460
Supposedly, most Oasis soldiers
are born and bred in the Oasis...

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:24.240
...including you, right?

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.270
<i>Wow!</i>

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:27.570
<i>You're from the Oasis!</i>

00:13:28.340 --> 00:13:31.210
No wonder you're
so naive about everything...

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:36.710
So, what is an Oasis soldier
doing in a place like this?

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:41.320
<i>You're pretty smart.</i>

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:44.490
<i>And you seem to know the score.</i>

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:47.340
Which is why people
all over are out to get me.

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:53.590
<i>I... can't live shrewdly like you do.</i>

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:00.050
<i>How dare you!</i>

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:02.300
<i>How dare you hurt my friends!</i>

00:14:03.680 --> 00:14:06.210
Yikes, he's those guys' friend?!

00:14:06.210 --> 00:14:07.930
<i>W-what now?!</i>

00:14:12.220 --> 00:14:16.220
OK, Masaru-kun! Go get him!

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:18.950
<i>Isn't that the opposite of
what you were just saying?!</i>

00:14:18.950 --> 00:14:22.990
You're the only one
who can protect the runts!

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:31.870
<i>Everything I always thought
was right since I was born</i>

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:36.330
<i>seems like crap now that
I've lost things to believe in!</i>

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:42.710
<i>That's why I'm here, doing this now!</i>

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:47.590
<i>To find the path meant for me!</i>

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:06.020
<i>Whoa!</i>

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:10.040
Scary. So that's what
true martial arts are...

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:11.080
<i>He's mine!</i>

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:12.750
<i>I found him first!</i>

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:15.820
I want him!

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:22.430
Alright! Nicely done!

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.880
<i>You're suddenly cheerful.</i>

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:28.170
A little!

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:33.200
You're agonizing over something stupid,
you know that?

00:15:33.200 --> 00:15:34.000
<i>How so?</i>

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:38.170
If there's something you
wanna believe in, just do it.

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:43.180
<i>Heh. You're the one who snubbed
what I do from the very start.</i>

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:46.810
I didn't say NOT to do it;
I just said I really hate it.

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:51.030
I dunno what your story is,

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:56.750
but you really will die out here
if you keep moping around.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:02.000
OK! I have 1.5 million!
Any other takers?!

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.730
<i>1.6!</i>

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:07.400
1.6 million! How generous of you, sir!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.740
Are there any others?!

00:16:08.740 --> 00:16:11.390
<i>- 1.8 million!
- Oh, man!</i>

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:14.250
<i>Your price sure has skyrocketed...</i>

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:18.030
They all saw that fight earlier.

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.350
<i>Don't you care, Masaru-san?</i>

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:26.220
<i>I have no choice. A promise is a promise.</i>

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:27.490
<i>Question!</i>

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:29.050
<i>Yes?</i>

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:35.010
<i>You rescued those children
because you want to help the weak...</i>

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:39.380
<i>...but you can't take
care of them forever, right?</i>

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.170
<i>I suppose not...</i>

00:16:42.170 --> 00:16:46.840
<i>Without you,
those weak children will die.</i>

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:49.840
<i>But if someone like my master saved them,</i>

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:57.310
<i>although traumatic from their perspective,
they'd still be able to live.</i>

00:16:57.310 --> 00:17:04.280
<i>Just by being alive, they'd have
a chance, or time, to get stronger.</i>

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:07.090
<i>Am I wrong, Master?!</i>

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:11.120
No, I haven't really put that
much thought into it or anything...

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:16.870
<i>In the end, aren't you simply
satisfying your own empowered ego</i>

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:22.140
<i>and hindering the weak from growing
stronger by spoiling them more?!</i>

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.130
<i>Yeah!</i>

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:29.550
<i>I almost fell into a
soft way of thinking myself,</i>

00:17:29.550 --> 00:17:32.390
<i>but my master's words earlier saved me!</i>

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:37.150
Umm, no, I was just insulting you...

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:44.170
Nah, he knows all about that.
Or else he wouldn't be distraught.

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:45.200
<i>But!</i>

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:51.510
<i>So this is the Great Kanto Desert...</i>

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:52.590
Yup.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:53.500
<i>Still...</i>

00:17:55.610 --> 00:18:01.620
<i>I AM going to look for my path,
after all...</i>

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:05.550
<i>There're people who want
to grow strong but can't.</i>

00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:08.760
<i>There're others who'll die
before they get a chance to.</i>

00:18:08.760 --> 00:18:10.870
<i>I'm going to help them.</i>

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.560
<i>In an even better way...</i>

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:16.830
<i>Alright! I'll pay 2 million!</i>

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:19.630
OK! We've reached the big 2-mill!

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.960
<i>- Huh? Come to think of it,
where are those kids?</i>

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:21.960
- Any others?!

00:18:22.500 --> 00:18:25.640
<i>Freeze right there! Move and you're dead!</i>

00:18:26.240 --> 00:18:28.240
We ain't done nothin'!

00:18:28.240 --> 00:18:31.110
<i>Shut up! You'll have time
to talk at the station!</i>

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:32.810
What's the charge?!

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:35.180
<i>Fraud, theft, and murder!</i>

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:35.830
Huh?!

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:36.860
<i>And...</i>

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:42.140
<i>...aggravated assault against
the Water Station #3 Youth Group!</i>

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:45.280
Eh?! That was a youth group?!

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:49.400
<i>Master...</i>

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.500
Damn those brats!

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:55.500
<i>Unbelievable... To think
those two were actually...</i>

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:59.520
<i>...wanted thieves...</i>

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:11.280
"WANTED"

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:02.480
They'd pretend to be lost
and get travelers to pick 'em up,

00:19:02.480 --> 00:19:05.510
<i>money, food, and water!</i>

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:07.880
Talk about some shitty kids!

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:09.940
<i>They certainly fooled us...</i>

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:17.490
<i>And to top it off, the cops think
we're in cahoots with them!</i>

00:19:17.490 --> 00:19:22.140
<i>We DID nearly kill the youth group
that tried to apprehend them...</i>

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:32.570
<i>For three days' time, the three
were interrogated most violently.</i>

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:34.770
<i>Incredibly so!</i>

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:43.130
<i>Whee! Spinny, spinny! Spinny, spinny!</i>

00:19:43.130 --> 00:19:44.900
<i>However!</i>

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:47.890
<i>Upon learning of Masaru's background,</i>

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:50.390
<i>the interrogator's attitude
completely changed</i>

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:53.180
<i>and the three were acquitted and released.</i>

00:19:57.260 --> 00:19:59.090
<i>I still can't believe it...</i>

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:05.840
<i>Even little kids like them
have to resort to crime</i>

00:20:05.840 --> 00:20:07.910
<i>to survive in the Great Kanto Desert...</i>

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:11.650
<i>How sad... It truly is Hell!</i>

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:19.190
It's your fault! It's all because
you wanted to help people!

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.350
<i>W-what's with you?!</i>

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.620
I'm glad we're free and all...

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:27.230
...but the money those brats stole,
the youth group's medical fees...

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:31.000
I wound up having to pay
for all of it myself!

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.950
<i>That's because you're my owner!</i>

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:39.200
And I lost my secret base
just the other day, too!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:44.380
And being saved by you even though
you're entirely to blame

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:46.640
makes no sense at all!

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:50.550
<i>What the hell?! It's your
fault for being so damn greedy!</i>

00:21:00.130 --> 00:21:01.460
<i>How'd it go?!</i>

00:21:01.460 --> 00:21:02.880
Just peachy!

00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:05.500
<i>Great! So we got 2 million yen?!</i>

00:21:06.270 --> 00:21:07.600
No, half a million.

00:21:07.600 --> 00:21:09.870
<i>Eh?! Why did you lower the price?</i>

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:14.070
'Cause 2 million can't possibly
make up for our losses!

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:18.180
<i>I take it you thought of
something even better...</i>

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:21.600
Wanna hear it?!

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:25.310
<i>Eh?! You sold him to a homo?!</i>

00:21:27.090 --> 00:21:29.990
I wish you could've seen his face!

00:21:29.990 --> 00:21:33.450
<i>What do you eat to come up
with such cruel ideas?</i>

00:21:33.450 --> 00:21:37.960
I bet that hardhead'll
soften up a little now!

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:41.130
I told him this is
another way of helping people!

00:21:41.130 --> 00:21:43.430
<i>He's so going to hate us!</i>

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:52.350
<i>And so, on their way home...</i>

00:21:52.350 --> 00:21:54.310
<i>Master! Master! Look!</i>

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:59.900
<i>They're trying to get sympathy again.
Should we capture 'em?!</i>

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:04.360
- Eh?!

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:04.360
- Leave 'em be.

00:22:04.890 --> 00:22:10.890
They're way more Great Kanto Desert-ish
than that other dumbass.

00:22:16.000 --> 00:22:20.960
<i>The Great Kanto Desert is harsh, indeed.</i>

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:57.870
<i>Yo, it's Nice Guy of the Desert,
Kaido Masaru!</i>

00:23:57.870 --> 00:23:59.390
<i>Next episode, I start...</i>

00:23:59.390 --> 00:24:02.200
<i>Hey! For a guest,
you sure got some nerve!</i>

00:24:02.220 --> 00:24:04.710
<i>I haven't even gotten
to take over a preview yet!</i>

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:06.730
<i>Go get sold, loser!</i>

00:24:06.730 --> 00:24:08.260
<i>Next episode- 
"Kosuna and Full-Auto"</i>

00:24:08.260 --> 00:24:10.200
<i>Miss it and we'll possess you!</i>
